  "lexnlp": {
    "_note": "LexNLP extracts typed entities, not clauses. A category is predicted present when the listed extractor returns an entity inside a sentence that matches the trigger regex. This adaptation is ours and is documented as such. Governing Law is excluded: LexNLP's geo-entity extractor needs the lexpredict-legal-dictionary data, which is no longer available at its published URL.",
